    ║           Wheat FHB Multi-Study RNA-seq Pipeline Completed              ║
    ╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
    ║ Organism  : Triticum aestivum (IWGSC RefSeq v2.1)                       ║
    ║ Libraries : 501 (466 PE + 35 SE) across 15 studies                      ║
    ║ Focus     : Fusarium Head Blight (FHB) resistance                       ║
    ╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
    ║ Status    : ${status}
    ║ Completed : ${workflow.complete}
    ║ Duration  : ${workflow.duration}
    ║ Exit Code : ${workflow.exitStatus}
    ╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
    ║ S3 Results  : s3://my-bingya-bucket/Wheat_FHB/results/                  ║
    ║ Gene Counts : results/star_salmon/salmon.merged.gene_counts.tsv          ║
    ║ MultiQC     : results/multiqc/multiqc_report.html                        ║
    ╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
    ║ NEXT STEPS:                                                              ║
    ║  1. Review MultiQC — flag SE/PE batch effects, low mapping rate samples  ║
    ║  2. Download gene counts and run Wheat_FHB_DESeq2_analysis.R             ║
