                 subject: "Wheat FHB RNA-seq ${status}",
                 body: msg)
    } catch (Exception e) { println "Email failed: $e" }
}
*/

// ============================================================================
// EXECUTION COMMANDS (reference)
// ============================================================================
//
// STEP 1 — Download all 501 libraries:
//   nextflow run nf-core/fetchngs -r 1.12.0 \
//       --input Wheat_FHB_ids.csv \
//       --outdir ./raw_data \
//       --nf_core_pipeline rnaseq \
//       -profile docker
//
// STEP 2 — Download IWGSC RefSeq v2.1 genome (Ensembl Plants release 57):
//   wget https://ftp.ensemblgenomes.ebi.ac.uk/pub/plants/release-57/fasta/triticum_aestivum/dna/Triticum_aestivum.IWGSC.dna.toplevel.fa.gz
//   wget https://ftp.ensemblgenomes.ebi.ac.uk/pub/plants/release-57/gtf/triticum_aestivum/Triticum_aestivum.IWGSC.57.gtf.gz
//   aws s3 cp Triticum_aestivum.IWGSC.dna.toplevel.fa.gz s3://my-bingya-bucket/Wheat_FHB/genome/
//   aws s3 cp Triticum_aestivum.IWGSC.57.gtf.gz s3://my-bingya-bucket/Wheat_FHB/genome/
//
// STEP 3 — Run RNA-seq pipeline:
//   nextflow run nf-core/rnaseq -r 3.14.0 \
//       -profile docker \
//       -c Wheat_FHB_nextflow.config \
//       -resume
//
// STEP 4 — Download results for DESeq2:
//   aws s3 cp s3://my-bingya-bucket/Wheat_FHB/results/star_salmon/salmon.merged.gene_counts.tsv ./
//   aws s3 cp s3://my-bingya-bucket/Wheat_FHB/results/multiqc/multiqc_report.html ./
//
// ============================================================================
